---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — DSU Platinum"
  description="Privacy policy for the DSU Platinum affiliate partner program website."
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="px-[clamp(20px,5vw,64px)] pt-[clamp(96px,14vh,150px)] pb-[clamp(56px,10vh,104px)] max-w-[760px] mx-auto">
    <h1 class="font-medium text-[clamp(32px,5vw,48px)] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.015em] m-0">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-[15.5px] leading-[1.7] text-ink/80">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-medium text-[18px] text-ink m-0 mb-2">Controller</h2>
        <p class="m-0">
          Manjeet Singh Sangha<br />
          SWISS MEDIA - FZCO<br />
          Dubai Silicon Oasis, DDP, Building A2<br />
          Dubai, United Arab Emirates
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-medium text-[18px] text-ink m-0 mb-2">Data we collect</h2>
        <p class="m-0">
          This website is a static page: it contains no forms, no login, no newsletter sign-up, and sets no
          cookies or tracking/analytics scripts of its own. We do not collect, store, or process any personal
          data you enter, because there is nowhere on this page to enter it. All images, fonts, and video are
          served directly from this site, not from third-party trackers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-medium text-[18px] text-ink m-0 mb-2">Server log files</h2>
        <p class="m-0">
          Like virtually every website, our hosting provider automatically records standard technical
          information for each request (e.g. IP address, browser type, date and time, page requested) in
          server log files. This happens automatically and is used only for operating and securing the
          website — it is not merged with any other data source.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-medium text-[18px] text-ink m-0 mb-2">Links to external websites</h2>
        <p class="m-0">
          The "Become a Partner" buttons and the Noirlab mention link out to CopeCart (copecart.com) and
          Noirlab (noirlab.io) respectively. Once you follow one of those links and leave this site, that
          service's own privacy policy applies — we have no access to and no control over data processed on
          their platforms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-medium text-[18px] text-ink m-0 mb-2">Contact</h2>
        <p class="m-0">
          For any questions about this privacy policy, you can reach the controller at the address listed
          above.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
